Source: https://github.com/bluz71/vim-moonfly-colors/tree/2c883835f5b7b380a0a9e80695c420f7efebdfe4

fzf-moonfly.opts: exact color options from extras/moonfly-fzf.sh, with shell
export/continuations removed and --color VALUE rewritten as --color=VALUE.
starship-moonfly.toml: unchanged extras/moonfly-starship.toml; only its selected
palette is imported by the adapter, not module settings.
tmux-moonfly.conf: only the six exact style commands from extras/moonfly.tmux;
status-left/right, window formats, shell conditionals and shebang are omitted.

